// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`roll loop --help groups — US-DOSSIER-035 > AC6: EN/中 snapshots (single-language per locale, color scrubbed) 1`] = `
"Usage: roll loop <subcommand>
The autonomous delivery loop — grouped control / observe / alerts / maintain.

control   go · goal · pause · resume · reset · recover · reconcile
observe   watch · status · runs · log · events · signals · eval · cycles · cycle
alerts    alert list · alert ack · alert resolve · alert log
maintain  gc · fmt · mute · unmute · reconcile-pending · pardon-skip-list
internal  test · run-once · story · notify · enforce-tcr · precheck-ci · hotfix-head-context · agent-routes · adversarial · review-resize · self-downgrade · exhaustion-split

states    ACTIVE (a session may drive cards) · PAUSED (you or a tripped breaker stopped autonomous progress → roll loop resume)
drive     open an agent session and run roll loop go — nothing advances on its own
"
`;

exports[`roll loop --help groups — US-DOSSIER-035 > AC6: EN/中 snapshots (single-language per locale, color scrubbed) 2`] = `
"用法：roll loop <子命令>
自治交付循环——按作动/传感/告警/维护分组。

作动      go · goal · pause · resume · reset · recover · reconcile
传感      watch · status · runs · log · events · signals · eval · cycles · cycle
告警      alert list · alert ack · alert resolve · alert log
维护      gc · fmt · mute · unmute · reconcile-pending · pardon-skip-list
内部      test · run-once · story · notify · enforce-tcr · precheck-ci · hotfix-head-context · agent-routes · adversarial · review-resize · self-downgrade · exhaustion-split

状态      ACTIVE 运行中(会话可推进卡片) · PAUSED 已暂停(你或跳闸的熔断器停掉了自主推进 → roll loop resume)
驱动      开一个 agent 会话跑 roll loop go —— 没有任何东西会自行推进
"
`;
